=== LatticeAudit ===
Inputs whose minimum irregular-vertex count is known from Euler's formula.
'floor' is that minimum. 'fieldSing' is the cross field's own singular
triangles; 'outIrreg' is irregular vertices in the extracted mesh. The two
together say which side of extraction lost the structure.

